singanywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1633561/e44807dc-ff0f-4cd9-a8c0-70bcb2f0d743.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1633561/e44807dc-ff0f-4cd9-a8c0-70bcb2f0d743.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1633561/e44807dc-ff0f-4cd9-a8c0-70bcb2f0d743.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"\nArbeiten und entspannen in Ihrem ruhigen Zuhause auf Zeit am südlichen Rand der Rhein-Main-Region!\nDiese charmante und individuell eingerichtete Wohnung befindet sich in ruhiger Lage in der Gemeinde Eichenbühl,\nDas Apartment überzeugt mit lichtdurchflutetem Wohnbereich im modernen Cross-Over-Stil, gemütlichem Schlafzimmer mit komfortablem Doppelbett und einem zusätzlichen Schlafsofa (Länge 2,20 m) im Wohnzimmer. Von hier aus gelangen Sie direkt auf die möblierte Terrasse, die zum Frühstücken in der Morgensonne einlädt.  Das Apartment ist vollständig möbliert und mit allem ausgestattet, was Sie für einen angenehmen Aufenthalt benötigen. Der helle Arbeitsbereich eignet sich hervorragend fürs Homeoffice, während der freundliche Wohnbereich zum Entspannen einlädt. Versorgungsmöglichkeiten sind bequem erreichbar.\n\nGenießen Sie Komfort, Ruhe und die angenehme Umgebung – wir freuen uns auf Ihren Besuch!\n\nFür Radfahrer stehen sichere Stellplätze zur Verfügung, ein Fahrradverleih ist nur 500 Meter entfernt.  Der Schnittpunkt von Erftal- und Main-Radweg  befindet sich in unmittelbarer Nähe. Outdoor-Fans haben viele Möglichkeiten.\n\n\nWork and leisure in your cozy home away from home on the southern edge of the Rhine-Main region!\n\nThis charming apartment, individually furnished is situated in a quiet area in the small town of Eichenbühl.\nThe apartment offers you a light and aery living area in modern cross-over look, a cozy bedroom with a comfortable double bed, and an additional sofa bed (2.20 m l) in the living room. This room opens directly onto a furnished terrace, the ideal spot to enjoy breakfast in the gentle morning sun. The apartment is fully furnished and equipped with everything you need for a pleasant stay. The bright workspace is perfectly suitable for working from home, while the friendly living area is great for relaxing. Amenities are within easy reach.\nEnjoy comfort, serenity, and the idyllic surroundings – we are looking forward to your visit!\n\nA special highlight: you can use the outdoor resp. indoor pool free of charge by arrangement – excellentfor a refreshing dip after an active day or for relaxing on the weekend.\nSafe parking for bicycles is available, and a bike rental shop is just 500 meters away. The intersection of the Erftal and Main cycle paths is located nearby, plenty of outdoor activities are possible.\n","facilities":{"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"42"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"yes"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":99000,"deposit":120000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"990.00","deposit":"1200.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":0,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":20,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-03-30"}],"updated":"2026-03-30T10:56:02Z","__utId__":"ut1633561"}]